(7712420, 1267572, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fascinating! I can''t help but wonder who the caged sleeper would be. When my younger brother was a toddler he was very adept at climbing out of his cot, also at opening windows and escaping. He was drawn to an establishment that was part wrecking yard, part garage, on a busy, busy road. He accessed this via a shortcut through a field. My mother used a bike and roads and hoped to get to the business before he did.  Driven to her wits end she took to turning the cot upside down so that he was safely confined - in a cage. This bed would have been ideal!</td>', 'Fascinating! I can''t help but wonder who the caged sleeper would be. When my younger brother was a toddler he was very adept at climbing out of his cot, also at opening windows and escaping. He was drawn to an establishment that was part wrecking yard, part garage, on a busy, busy road. He accessed this via a shortcut through a field. My mother used a bike and roads and hoped to get to the business before he did.  Driven to her wits end she took to turning the cot upside down so that he was safely confined - in a cage. This bed would have been ideal!', '2022-01-22 01:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
